• To change the Width and the Color of the Connector, double-click its icon and enter and select the
settings you need.
• To reorder the sequence of the succeeding objects, i.e., the sequence of the Connectors, click the
object with the right mouse button and select Reorder Successors. Move the selected successor with
the Up or Down buttons.
